  "details": "Me and a group of people create daily events using specific instance numbers to show what day we're on. I've noticed that depending on what instance number you have, you can change the maximum user count for a world.\n\nI've seen this with a few instance numbers in the past, but I can only remember seeing instances #666 and #680 showing this behavior.\n\nEven though this can pretty much only happen through instance links, you may be able to create instances with user caps that the world creator did not intend to have or expect to reach, which could possibly break things.",
